        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "The capture of Hanuma, the son of Air-god, by the magical missile of Indrajit, son of Ravana, and also Hanuma's burning down Lanka, and his blaring at the demons, also his return flight from Lanka... and on his way back Hanuma's seeing a honey garden, and the appropriation of honey... [1-3-33]"
      }
    ],
